{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Story\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481240/extras/intro01.jpg.png?t=1744705453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I was born in a very fortunate position, with many maids in a luxurious mansion.<br>My excellent personal butler Chloe, and my gentle babysitter who always accompany me. My willful little sister Mirei and my beloved mother.<br>I had everything and my life was going smoothly and \u2026or so I thought until that day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, the protagonist learned that the mansion he lived in was actually the mansion of a villain family.<br>His reliable father was actually a cruel warmonger. His real mother was a war widow from an invaded area. The tyrannical father seems to be invading the protagonist's hometown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to stop his father's evil plan and reunite with his mother, the protagonist tries to escape from this twisted family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hide from the mansion owners and the maids and escape this mansion filled with evil women!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010How to Play\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481240/extras/intro02_steam.gif?t=1744705453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The controlling is simple, just run away from the chasing women.<br>Your goal is to escape from the mansion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Characters\u3011</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481240/extras/chara03.png?t=1744705453\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Chloe</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tall butler with a 